                      },
                      {
                        "align": "center",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "3f0sdpxyo7lcwnt",
                            "text": "0.010 + "
                          },
                          {
                            "em": true,
                            "id": "c7q4n27xk1nyqpi",
                            "text": "x"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "d4kyokyh96xrk81",
                            "text": " M"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "gfu32rzikeob5do",
                        "type": "td"
                      },
                      {
                        "align": "center",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "em": true,
                            "id": "tqs82zhohhljf20",
                            "text": "x"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "xmv53pwfjjxwfsn",
                            "text": " M"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "g5zrjlz48xdwq38",
                        "type": "td"
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "3azh23w5dn9l7ey",
                    "type": "tr"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "988bonwxusuyqlu",
                "rowstyle": "alternating",
                "type": "table"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "u51u5t3af72rdg7",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "0esa51m07ylyj3m",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{l}K_{\\mathrm{sp}}\\;=\\;\\lbrack\\mathrm{Cd}^{2+}\\rbrack\\lbrack\\mathrm S^{2-}\\rbrack\\;=\\;1.0\\times10^{-28}\\\\(0.010\\;+\\;x)\\;(x)\\;=\\;1.0\\times10^{-28}\\\\x^2\\;+\\;0.010x\\;-\\;1.0\\times10^{-28}\\;=\\;0\\\\\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "We can solve this equation using the quadratic formula, but we can also make an assumption to make this calculation much simpler. Because the "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "K"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "sp"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " value is so small compared with the cadmium concentration, we can assume that the change between the initial concentration and the equilibrium concentration is negligible, so that 0.010 + "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "x"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ~ 0.010. Going back to our "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "K"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "sp"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " expression, we would now get: "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "czfftftf85gw6z2",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "6ex2q669wb8l3pj",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "tjmoahu1mbthfai",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{l}K_{\\mathrm{sp}}\\;=\\;\\lbrack\\mathrm{Cd}^{2+}\\rbrack\\lbrack\\mathrm S^{2-}\\rbrack\\;=\\;1.0\\times10^{-28}\\\\(0.010)\\;(x)\\;=\\;1.0\\times10^{-28}\\\\x\\;=\\;1.0\\times10^{-26}\\\\\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Therefore, the molar solubility of CdS in this solution is 1.0 × 10"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "–26"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " M."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "imxkhgvx8kbesvj",
                "type": "p"
              }
